DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260923T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260923T213000
UID:4db1fcf609ac4e2b9724084b@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Maitreyabandhu\, a senior member of the Triratna Buddhist Orde
 r\, will be exploring the Three Prerequisites\, the fundamental qualities 
 we need to explore life in a healthy\, integral way. Suitable for complete
  newcomers and those who have already begun to explore life more deeply. Y
 ou are welcome to come to the whole series or drop into as many sessions a
 s you like.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/wed-night-class-23-sep
END:VEVENT
